# Shell scripts are submitted to SLURM on Linux. A CRLF .sh dies immediately with
# "/bin/bash^M: bad interpreter", and this repo is worked on from Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF on every checkout.
# Pin them to LF in the worktree so a Globus transfer can never stage a broken one.
*.sh text eol=lf
